// title: MC847884   Check iOS 16 mobile outlook users due to out of support in Sep 2024
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Entra
// tables: SigninLogs
// purpose: MC847884 Check iOS 16 mobile outlook users due to out of support in Sep 2024
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/MC847884%20-%20Check%20iOS%2016%20mobile%20outlook%20users%20due%20to%20out%20of%20support%20in%20Sep%202024.kql
